units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
newton on
lattice bcc 3.3
region whole block 0 20 0 20 0 64.54545454545455 units lattice
create_box 1 whole
region proj block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region targ block 0 20 0 20 24.545454545454547 64.54545454545455 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal
thermo 1000
velocity all create 300 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix nvt_all all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt_all
velocity projectile add 0 0 20 sum yes
fix nve_all all nve
run 100000
